  "instructions": [
    "Heat a non-stick pan over medium heat and melt 2 tbsp of butter.",
    "Add the pre-fried teque os fillets to the pan and warm for 3 minutes on each side until just heated through.",
    "Slide the warmed fillets onto one half of each ciabatta roll.",
    "Sprinkle sea salt and black pepper over the fillets.",
    "Spread a layer of bonito-shave over the fillets for extra flavor.",
    "Top each with 50g of crispy parsnip chips.",
    "Squeeze a lemon wedge over the chips for brightness.",
    "Close the sandwich with the other roll half and serve immediately."
